=   entry .Error   raised when a resource is not on the classpath
-     detail
+     detail

-         Error `↯/s.67.1`: _the resource `path` was not on the classpath_. Raised by the `Streamable`
-         givens for `Resource` and `Path on Classpath` when the `Classloader` in scope does
-         not have the resource. A `cp"…"` resource is checked at compile time against the
-         compiler's classpath, so this error at runtime means the program was launched with a
-         different one.
-     entry #resource   the path which was asked for
-   entry .Event   what a classloader logs as it reads resources
+         Errore `↯/s.67.1`: _the resource `path` was not on the classpath_. Sollevato dai given
+         `Streamable` per `Resource` e `Path on Classpath` quando il `Classloader` nell'ambito
+         non ha la risorsa. Una risorsa `cp"…"` viene verificata a tempo di compilazione sul
+         classpath del compilatore, quindi questo errore a runtime significa che il programma è
+         stato avviato con un classpath diverso.
